# Hosts and paths lychee should skip (one regex per line).

# The public repository is not published yet — every self-referencing link
# (repo, issues, discussions, security advisories) returns 404 until it is.
# TODO: remove this block once https://github.com/Tooark/vscode-ark-format is live.
https://github\.com/Tooark/vscode-ark-format.*

# Marketplace / badge endpoints that rate-limit or block bots.
https://marketplace\.visualstudio\.com/.*
https://open-vsx\.org/.*
https://img\.shields\.io/.*
https://flagcdn\.com/.*

# Local build/test output.
.*/dist/.*
.*/out/.*
.*/coverage/.*
